== 3. 공정/기술 상세: 불량을 만드는 공정 모듈과 검출 체계

=== 3.1 3D NAND 셀 어레이 형성 흐름과 불량 발생 지점

```text
  1. ONON stack deposition (SiO2/SiN x N)   -> thickness variation, warpage
  2. Staircase etch (trim-etch repeat)      -> step CD, landing area
  3. Channel hole HAR etch                  -> CD profile, bending, twist, clog
  4. ONO + poly channel + core fill         -> thickness, pinhole, grain, void
  5. Channel plug / inter-deck plug         -> misalignment, contact
  6. Slit (WL cut) etch                     -> profile, punch, not-open
  7. SiN removal (hot H3PO4) via slit       -> residue, over-etch, collapse
  8. Blocking Al2O3 + TiN + W fill via slit -> seam, void, WL bridge/open
  9. W recess / slit fill                   -> WL-WL bridge, slit short
 10. Source contact / CSL                   -> source resistance, open
 11. WL contact on staircase                -> punch-through, open, misland
 12. BL / metal / peri (or bonding)         -> RC, open, bond void
```

